# L §2.5 (writer 8): "A movement's fields are its legs, its declared attributes and the built-in fields day and
# fulfils (§5.14). Its kind is not a field: membership, subkinds included, is tested with m in K (§5.7)"; L §2.2 the
# built-in fields of a movement are `day fulfils`. x.kind is no field: LOAD-FIELD. (Was round 14's readable kind,
# removed by the review.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
kind groceries: transfers
input amt: money PLN
input d1: date
input d2: date

move shop: groceries
  on d1
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

move gift: transfers
  on d2
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN
  d1 = 2026-03-01
  d2 = 2026-04-01
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask q1: count(x in transfers over 2026 where x.kind == "groceries")
=== expect
refused: LOAD-FIELD kind is not a field of transfers (m.tally:33)
